{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:767","content":{"id":767,"title":"导出","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有的内容都支持四种格式的导出："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Markdown"}]},{"type":"callout","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为我们支持的样式超出了 Markdown 表达的范围，比如渐变色，Magic Move 的代码块，为了能导入我们导出的 Markdown，本软件对这些标准 Markdown 不支持的样式使用了自定义的语法，可以保证无损的还原导出内容，我们的软件也能正常打开这些 Markdown 文件，但是其它 Markdown 文件无法识别我们的自定义语法，也就不能正常渲染，如果你追求软件无关，那么就不要使用这些自定义的样式，只使用标准的 Markdown 语法就行。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"calloutType":"warning","title":"注意"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b9c528c4-812d-4375-8988-b072435853d7.webp","uuid":"4f9f709b-4bd0-4704-9529-7e15267039e3","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_b9c528c4-812d-4375-8988-b072435853d7.webp","width":720}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"PDF，支持多种纸张大小的导出，以及一些导出策略"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a066e3e4-2a45-498f-85d1-89c238710eda.webp","uuid":"b24c9b62-a4b6-45b7-b8e1-7fa5463a5d6b","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a066e3e4-2a45-498f-85d1-89c238710eda.webp","width":720}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"EPUB"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_ff482e48-7e05-44f8-9de2-473aae719eb9.webp","uuid":"6e